# The shader warm-up lists are embedded as raw string literals (port-nx/src/shader_warmup.cpp).
# They are generated locally and not tracked (.gitignore); if one is ever added, keep its line
# endings as written.
*/warmup/shader_warmup.inc text eol=lf
# The Linux build's scripts and container file (tools/*.sh, tools/linux/): LF whatever the
# checkout's core.autocrlf, or bash and podman can't read them.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.Containerfile text eol=lf
